<title>USA: Omaha hogs up fully $1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up fully $1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were fully $1.50 higher. Top $59.25 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs    59.00-59.25</p>
<p>    US 2-3    260-280 lbs    58.00-58.50</p>
<p>Sows - firm/up $1.00. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    350-450 lbs    45.25</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    46.50</p>
</text>
